end equipment, a SPA, a playground, running tracks, a golf course, a spacious recreation area, a cinema and the St. Regis library.The strategically advantageous location of the complex allows residents to quickly get to key points of the city. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are within walking distance, Dubai International Airport can be reached in 15 minutes, and Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are within 30-35 minutes by car.The St. Regis Residences is a unique combination of modern urban life and elegance. The complex is ideal for those who are looking for a luxurious lifestyle in the heart of a bustling metropolis.","price":20647100,"title":"The St. Regis Residences","bitrix":{"id":682,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The St. Regis Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The St. Regis Residences","property_type":"Penthouse","developer_name":"Refine Development","project_location":"Downtown Dubai"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/340x252/RbHXOOsjLMy5yAlG2bavh9RwwbnHYOwY0TWflmmx.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/464x312/RbHXOOsjLMy5yAlG2bavh9RwwbnHYOwY0TWflmmx.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1954607,"lng":55.2628731},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/340x252/b4Q5Ls4f0wbJSRoMGC2h711YY1ZrKYM0JwvIsH3S.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/464x312/b4Q5Ls4f0wbJSRoMGC2h711YY1ZrKYM0JwvIsH3S.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/340x252/K66aiWWBwXaa8bwX0zLb59vXwuNISCYPnxYgdwDY.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/464x312/K66aiWWBwXaa8bwX0zLb59vXwuNISCYPnxYgdwDY.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/340x252/YKHmgoe1VTPp4ywjGqxseAd8ipvgQiml3ieQOqQb.webp"